{"ticker":"KPRMILL","symbol":"KPRMILL","instrumentId":3096874,"name":"Kpr Mill","industry":"NSE-Apparel-Clothing Mfg","about":"K.P.R. Mill Ltd. is one of India’s foremost textile manufacturers, producing high-quality yarn, fabrics, and garments. The company operates advanced production facilities and caters to both domestic and international markets. Its offerings are widely used in industries like fashion, retail, and home textiles. In addition to textiles, K.P.R. Mill has diversified into sugar production, enhancing its overall business portfolio. Known for its vertically integrated operations, the company focuses on efficiency and sustainability, ensuring high-quality products. With a strong presence across various geographies, K.P.R. Mill Ltd. serves a wide range of customers, from large fashion brands to retailers globally.","website":"www.kprmilllimited.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:34:08.025Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1189.4,"changePct":-1.4989648033126217,"week52High":1218.45,"week52Low":810.9},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹40,655 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹7,127 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"109,380,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"223"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"89,451,118"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.42%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"7.14"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.6"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"1.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.07"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.8"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"39.13"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"23–57"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"15.2%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"32.41"},{"label":"Volume","value":"708,571"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"268,793"},{"label":"Master score","value":"68"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"73"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"77"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"53"},{"label":